% stop_committed — the committed action (spec/15 amendment 9, wc-member s-4fe6cfd6): a stop while d2 holds r on a committed action and d1's ticket waits: d1 is passed over, d2 is not revoked; its revoke waits for its yield.
% Gate 22: one stop_committed, one stop_dequeue, no stop_release and no grant on every seed.
catalog stop_committed 1.
provenance text "the director's stop and a committed action" "2026-10-30".
include "iface/director_tree_domain.llp".
include "types.llp".
type kind {none}.
bwd specialist(domain).
specialist(d1).
specialist(d2).
young_grant(a0).
young_grant(a1).
mature_grant(a2).
mature_grant(a3).
mature_status(a1).
mature_status(a2).
mature_status(a3).
#init tick__stop 1
#init nocommit(d1) 1
#init commit(d2, r) 1
#init holder(d2, r) 1
#init held(d2, a1) 1
#init queued(d1, r, t1) 1
#init serving(r, t1) 1
#init issue(r, t2) 1
#init offpath(d1) 1
#init path(d2) 1
#init tick__goal(d2) 1
#init age_of(d1, a0) 1
#init age_of(d2, a0) 1
#steps 20
#seeds 10
